==========================================
          WORLD SIMULATION ROADMAP
==========================================

PROJECT VISION
--------------
Create a persistent fantasy world where kingdoms, cities, and NPCs exist
independently of the player. Every person has a life, goals, relationships,
memories, and can influence history. The world continues evolving whether
the player is present or not.

