==========================================
LONG-TERM DREAM
==========================================

The player enters a world that has already existed for hundreds of years.

NPCs:
- remember
- learn
- age
- marry
- work
- travel
- fight
- rule
- die

Kingdoms:
- rise
- collapse
- trade
- wage war

Cities:
- grow
- shrink
- starve
- prosper

The player is not the center of the world.

The world lives with or without them.
